cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use SpatioS2E, please cite the archived software release and the associated manuscript.
title: "SpatioS2E: component-resolved evaluation of gene-conditioned virtual spatial transcriptomics"
type: software
abstract: >-
  SpatioS2E provides fitted-target and target-disjoint experimental systems for
  gene-conditioned virtual spatial transcriptomics. It includes
  component-resolved endpoints that separate gene-mean log-expression from
  within-gene spatial variation, matched gene-vector controls, held-out-target
  decoders and frozen manuscript analysis contracts.
authors:
